{
  "source": "../api/engines.md",
  "modules": [
    {
      "textRaw": "引擎 (Engines)",
      "name": "引擎_(engines)",
      "desc": "<p>engines 模块包含脚本引擎枚举、脚本执行、脚本停止和跨引擎事件通信相关函数.</p>\n",
      "modules": [
        {
          "textRaw": "6.7.0 源码校对",
          "name": "6.7.0_源码校对",
          "desc": "<p>本页已按 AutoJs6 <code>6.7.0</code> (<code>ed3eb10e88db5a8425fd94bdddefa4176e5e1c94</code>) 对照以下源码路径校对:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>app/src/main/java/org/autojs/autojs/runtime/ScriptRuntime.kt</code></li>\n<li><code>app/src/main/java/org/autojs/autojs/runtime/api/augment/engines/Engines.kt</code></li>\n<li><code>app/src/main/java/org/autojs/autojs/runtime/api/Engines.kt</code></li>\n<li><code>app/src/main/java/org/autojs/autojs/execution/ExecutionConfig.kt</code></li>\n<li><code>app/src/main/java/org/autojs/autojs/engine/JavaScriptEngine.java</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p>运行时中 <code>engines</code> 既是 <code>ScriptRuntime</code> 字段, 也由 augment 层补充同名模块函数. 当前公开入口包括 <code>all</code>, <code>myEngine</code>, <code>getEngines</code>, <code>stopAll</code>, <code>stopAllAndToast</code>, <code>execScript</code>, <code>execScriptFile</code>, <code>execAutoFile</code>.</p>\n<p><code>engines</code> 实现 <code>AsEmitter</code>, 因此模块对象本身具备事件发射能力. 当前引擎启动时, <code>ExecutionConfig.arguments</code> 会被转换为 <code>myEngine().execArgv</code>.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>注: <code>execScript</code> / <code>execScriptFile</code> / <code>execAutoFile</code> 的 <code>config.path</code> 或 <code>config.workingDirectory</code> 在 <code>6.7.0</code> 源码中代表脚本工作目录, 不是旧文档里描述的 <code>require</code> 搜索路径数组.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font: bold 2em sans-serif; color: #FF7043\">engines</p>\n\n<hr>\n",
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "6.7.0 源码校对"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] execScript",
          "name": "[m]_execscript",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "execScript(name, script, config?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "execScript",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "textRaw": "**name** {string} - 要运行的脚本名称, 用于任务显示和源码标识. ",
                      "name": "**name**",
                      "type": "string",
                      "desc": "要运行的脚本名称, 用于任务显示和源码标识."
                    },
                    {
                      "textRaw": "**script** {string} - 要运行的脚本文本. ",
                      "name": "**script**",
                      "type": "string",
                      "desc": "要运行的脚本文本."
                    },
                    {
                      "textRaw": "**[ config ]** {Object} - 运行配置. ",
                      "name": "**[",
                      "desc": "config ]** {Object} - 运行配置."
                    },
                    {
                      "textRaw": "<ins>**returns**</ins> { ScriptExecution } ",
                      "name": "<ins>**returns**</ins>",
                      "type": " ScriptExecution "
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "name"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "script"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "config?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "desc": "<p>在新的脚本环境中执行字符串脚本. 新环境中的全局变量与当前脚本不共享, 脚本会在新的线程中运行.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">engines.execScript(&#39;hello world&#39;, &#39;toast(&quot;hello world&quot;)&#39;);\n</code></pre>\n<p><code>execScript</code> 内部使用 <code>StringScriptSource</code>, source prefix 为 <code>$engine/</code>.</p>\n"
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m] execScript"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] execScriptFile",
          "name": "[m]_execscriptfile",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "execScriptFile(path, config?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "execScriptFile",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "textRaw": "**path** {string} - 要运行的脚本路径. ",
                      "name": "**path**",
                      "type": "string",
                      "desc": "要运行的脚本路径."
                    },
                    {
                      "textRaw": "**[ config ]** {Object} - 运行配置. ",
                      "name": "**[",
                      "desc": "config ]** {Object} - 运行配置."
                    },
                    {
                      "textRaw": "<ins>**returns**</ins> { ScriptExecution } ",
                      "name": "<ins>**returns**</ins>",
                      "type": " ScriptExecution "
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "path"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "config?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "desc": "<p>在新的脚本环境中运行脚本文件.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">engines.execScriptFile(&#39;/sdcard/scripts/receiver.js&#39;);\n</code></pre>\n<p>源码会将 <code>path</code> 解析为非空运行时路径, 并使用 <code>JavaScriptFileSource</code> 执行.</p>\n"
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m] execScriptFile"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] execAutoFile",
          "name": "[m]_execautofile",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "execAutoFile(path, config?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "execAutoFile",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "textRaw": "**path** {string} - 要运行的录制文件路径. ",
                      "name": "**path**",
                      "type": "string",
                      "desc": "要运行的录制文件路径."
                    },
                    {
                      "textRaw": "**[ config ]** {Object} - 运行配置. ",
                      "name": "**[",
                      "desc": "config ]** {Object} - 运行配置."
                    },
                    {
                      "textRaw": "<ins>**returns**</ins> { ScriptExecution } ",
                      "name": "<ins>**returns**</ins>",
                      "type": " ScriptExecution "
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "path"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "config?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "desc": "<p>在新的脚本环境中运行录制文件.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">engines.execAutoFile(&#39;/sdcard/scripts/1.auto&#39;);\n</code></pre>\n<p>源码会将 <code>path</code> 解析为非空运行时路径, 并使用 <code>AutoFileSource</code> 执行.</p>\n"
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m] execAutoFile"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[p] config",
          "name": "[p]_config",
          "desc": "<p><code>execScript</code>, <code>execScriptFile</code>, <code>execAutoFile</code> 的 <code>config</code> 可为空, 或为 <code>ExecutionConfig</code> / JavaScript 对象.</p>\n<p>支持字段:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>path</code> {string} - 工作目录, 会写入 <code>ExecutionConfig.workingDirectory</code>.</li>\n<li><code>workingDirectory</code> {string} - 工作目录, 与 <code>path</code> 等价.</li>\n<li><code>delay</code> {number} - 延迟执行毫秒数, 默认 <code>0</code>.</li>\n<li><code>interval</code> {number} - 循环间隔毫秒数, 默认 <code>0</code>.</li>\n<li><code>loopTimes</code> {number} - 循环次数, 默认 <code>1</code>, <code>0</code> 表示无限循环.</li>\n<li><code>arguments</code> {Object} - 启动参数, 会写入新引擎的 <code>execArgv</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>非法 <code>config</code> 类型会抛出参数异常.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">let execution = engines.execScriptFile(&#39;./worker.js&#39;, {\n    workingDirectory: files.cwd(),\n    delay: 1000,\n    arguments: {\n        from: engines.myEngine().getSource().toString(),\n    },\n});\n</code></pre>\n",
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[p] config"
        },
        {
